                                                "sense_id": "8e3afbfe-9ac7-38d4-b088-f1e15fefb61c",
                                                "text": "The only published study (Feigen, 1954), which looked at 68 adults engaging in consensual anal sex, found that “it was not possible to relate the appearance of the anus to the practice of sodomy; there was no appreciable difference of the anus in those who practiced sodomy frequently and those that practiced it rarely\" (p. 81)."
